     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reactions and memories",
     "texto": [
      "**Mimo** («in spite of») takes the genitive: **mimo deszczu**. **Po chwili** means «after a moment».",
      "For an experience not had until then you can use **nigdy wcześniej** («never before»); the past verb keeps agreement with gender."
     ],
